Author: Meer

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 0
    Minor: 1
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: McM3 - Meer Cheat Manager 3ds

Summary: A clean in-game cheat manager. Open with R + Down + Select.

Description: |
  McM3 (Meer Cheat Manager 3ds)

  Open the menu in any game with R + Down + Select.

  Features:
    - Terminal style overlay on both screens
    - Loads Action Replay codes from sd:/McM3/cheats or sd:/cheats
    - Remembers which cheats you turned on, per game

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 2MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
